  "goodToKnow": "Der Brandschutz is fire safety or fire protection. German Brandschutz rules are famously strict: smoke detectors (Rauchmelder) are compulsory in homes in all 16 states, and buildings need fire doors and escape routes. The fire protection system was a main reason for the years of delays at Berlin's BER airport. Most German fire brigades are volunteer forces (Freiwillige Feuerwehr). It has no plural."
